  "prompt": "An expressive oil painting of a seashore in impasto style, with the shoreline occupying about 60% of the canvas and the sky the remaining 40%. Thick, sculptural oil paint is applied with visible brush strokes and palette knife techniques. The ocean features deep blues, turquoise, and whites, with textured, raised paint that captures the motion and energy of the waves crashing onto the sandy shore. The sand is rendered in warm ochres, golds, and beiges with equally heavy texture, giving a dimensional, almost sculpted appearance. The sky above is softer but still textured with impasto strokes in pale blues, soft grays, or sunset tones, occupying a smaller portion of the scene. The entire painting has a rich, 3D tactile feel, emphasizing movement, depth, and the physicality of oil paint. --ar 3:4 --raw",
